    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven co-op horror and survival adventure.</strong><br>The world has ended, yet the bunker\u2019s AI refuses to stop producing human-conscious robots. As a massive magnetic storm chases you from behind, explore abandoned zones with your scrap vehicle, mine crystals, gather valuable parts, and purchase items from vending machines to keep going. Along the way, uncover the story of other failed robots and fight against terrifying monsters that roam the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mornings are safer, but at night, always watch your back.<br>The one beside you might not be your friend, but a mimic robot in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world where even the rain is merciless, every action is a choice and every delay is a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is the first game I've developed solo, your thoughts and feedback mean a lot to me. I\u2019ll continue working on fixing bugs and improving the experience. Don\u2019t forget to leave a review. I hope you enjoy it \u2014 have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397400/extras/0350eec6fed46522b8c9009d156ca488.avif?t=1749410141\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven co-op horror and survival adventure.</strong><br>The world has ended, yet the bunker\u2019s AI refuses to stop producing human-conscious robots. As a massive magnetic storm chases you from behind, explore abandoned zones with your scrap vehicle, mine crystals, gather valuable parts, and purchase items from vending machines to keep going. Along the way, uncover the story of other failed robots and fight against terrifying monsters that roam the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mornings are safer, but at night, always watch your back.<br>The one beside you might not be your friend, but a mimic robot in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world where even the rain is merciless, every action is a choice and every delay is a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is the first game I've developed solo, your thoughts and feedback mean a lot to me. I\u2019ll continue working on fixing bugs and improving the experience. Don\u2019t forget to leave a review. I hope you enjoy it \u2014 have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397400/extras/0350eec6fed46522b8c9009d156ca488.avif?t=1749410141\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
